WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:06.470
Last year, the Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture's attempts to recruit

00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:08.900
new members ended in absolute failure.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:13.270
What do you feel was the 
cause of this failure?

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:17.160
I guess it was all the cosplay 
outfits I brought...

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.670
And how I wore them during my heroics!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:24.640
That's right. So this year you 
won't be doing either.

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:28.620
First, Ohno-sempai will not be cosplaying 
during our recruitment efforts.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.250
And Kuchiki-sempai will not 
be allowed to be present.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.470
I'm not even allowed to be there?

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:39.570
I had to do what I did to 
catch the cosplay thieves!

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:43.070
It's true that there was an 
attempt to steal the costumes.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:46.460
But in the end, that 
meant that nobody joined.

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:51.360
<b>The Society for the Study 
of Modern Visual Culture</b>

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.790
So these are my orders as circle president.

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:53.710
If we don't get any new members 
for two straight years in a row,

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:55.880
we might end up getting shut down.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:56.280
Oh no. What an awful location.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:57.950
But Ogiue-san...

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.620
It looks like a rabbit hutch!

00:00:59.620 --> 00:01:00.990
Uwah!

00:01:04.990 --> 00:01:07.770
We did get one new member.

00:01:07.770 --> 00:01:10.060
Did you make her walk around 
campus wearing that?

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:12.130
Ogiue Chika is my waifu!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.780
That's all she wants to say.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.620
Now, now...

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:16.760
Kuchiki-kun, I'm confiscating your cellphone.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.050
You're cosplaying anyway.

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.720
We just need to make sure 
Kuchiki-kun doesn't.

00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:26.240
That's true, but...

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:28.520
I'd feel bad making Sue be the only one.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.980
That's a lie.

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.240
I'd hoped we could get another guy to 
join, but I guess that's not happening.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.410
Why is that?

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:41.170
The only guy we've got right 
now is Kuchiki-sempai.

00:01:41.170 --> 00:01:42.190
I want another one to keep an eye on him.

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:45.130
He's been treating this place like 
his harem, come to think of it.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:47.650
Oh, but if a guy joined...

00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:51.520
Sasahara-san graduated. 
Wouldn't he be worried?

00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.670
What are you talking about? 
That doesn't matter!

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.790
Are you confident about that?

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.850
No, I mean...

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:00.200
You're working hard at getting new members.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.840
Are you trying to imply that's not like me?

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:03.710
That's not true.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:06.440
Well, wouldn't it bother you?

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:11.600
If, a few years down the road, you heard 
that the circle you were in shut down.

00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.540
Yeah, I guess that would bother me.

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.580
Good luck, Miss President!

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:18.360
You don't need to tell me.

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:19.930
By the way, Ogiue-san.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:21.040
Yes?

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:25.980
I read the draft you gave me. 
Can I tell you what I thought?

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:27.040
Yes!

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.540
Please.

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:33.930
I stayed up all night fixing the draft. 
I don't have confidence right now.

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:36.090
Confidence isn't...

00:02:38.170 --> 00:02:42.220
Hey, Sue! Those were for Comic Festival! 
Where did you get them?

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.640
Oh, did you find those in the circle room?

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.770
<b>By Your Side</b>

00:02:44.180 --> 00:02:47.770
<b>Alphabet Play</b>

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.230
And those are mine! You're doing 
this deliberately again, aren't you?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:53.110
<b>Shiiou University Manga Research circle</b>

00:02:51.900 --> 00:02:53.730
Oh, how's it going over there?

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:57.000
We're right next to you. Just look.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:00.740
I'm not good with that blonde 
girl. And I know she'd find me.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.240
We've got a lot of girls here this year.

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.400
If I see any really weird ones, 
want me to send them to you?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:05.990
Huh?

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:09.540
Maybe with a nasty look in their eyes. 
Someone who'd jump out a second story window.

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.040
I'll pass.

00:03:11.890 --> 00:03:13.430
Was that Yabusaki-san?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:14.280
Yabu?

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.570
She was just bragging.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:18.920
They must have a lot of new members.

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:24.600
Okay, it's time for me to get started too.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.220
Okay!

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:30.140
This year I'm going to do this the right 
way. I'm going to do what I can do.

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.270
It's the only thing I can do.

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:56.540
<b>Genshiken Second Generation</b>

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.580
<b>The Society for 
the Study of Modern Visual Culture 
Drawing Demonstration</b>

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.220
Looking good!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:10.130
The stage is set!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:14.010
All that's left is for 
me, the main character,

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:22.140
to finish things off with my "Ramen Angel 
Pretty Menma - Elect Makeup Version" cosplay!

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:31.330
There's two more pieces 
of clothing to get rid of.

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:35.160
Sue's showing her cold face!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:38.350
Wait! No! This was expensive!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:44.710
Damn it! Kasukabe-sempai!

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.770
The other side of the 
path. The promised place.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.510
I'm Yajima.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:54.800
I'm Yoshitake!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.320
You did it, Ogiue-san! Two new members!

00:05:57.320 --> 00:05:58.700
Yeah...

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.850
Did you two join after you saw her drawing?

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:05.250
Yeah. I'm an artist too so I was impressed.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.710
Yeah! All those people watching and 
she didn't look embarrassed at all.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:12.360
Not many people could draw a picture of Yuki 
x Shige with so many people looking at them!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.000
No, that wasn't quite like that...

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:17.980
No, no! That was totally Yuki x Shige!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.390
I knew these are the kind of girls 
who my drawing would attract.

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:25.720
I guess it doesn't matter. I don't 
like the way Kuchiki-sempai is looking.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:26.900
More for my harem!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:29.610
Forty-five grams of confusion, 
and five grams of embarrassment.

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:32.610
Ogiue-san's a proffesional manga artist!

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:34.310
Seriously? Where?

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:36.650
No, I just have one work published.

00:06:36.650 --> 00:06:37.810
And she has a boyfriend!

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.590
Y-Your life sounds really nice.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:42.130
So do you, Ohno-sempai!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:44.120
And her boyfriend's a manga editor!

00:06:44.120 --> 00:06:45.460
He's got a real job!

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:47.960
Do you really get work 
by sleeping with someone?

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.220
The protagonist gets everything!

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.050
I don't even feel like answering that.

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:53.360
The president is my waifu!

00:06:53.360 --> 00:06:54.850
Forget that, Sue.

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:57.280
If you love her that much, 
you should marry her!

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:58.880
Way to go, Sue!

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.330
Um...

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.780
May I come in for a while?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:07.870
Of course, come in.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:09.240
You can sit here.

00:07:09.470 --> 00:07:10.490
What's your name?

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:12.700
Um, Hato.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.890
Kuchiki-sempai is scared.

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:17.950
Do normal pretty girls scare him? 
I guess he is an otaku.

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:20.970
Hey. Can I ask a question, everybody?

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:25.210
How many of the girls here 
could be described as "rotten?"

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.910
Does that sort of topic bother you?
If it does, I won't bring it up.

00:07:28.910 --> 00:07:30.140
I'm fine.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:32.260
She was just talking about Yuki x Shige...

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.410
I'm alright, I mean.

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:37.430
I like it.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.920
Great, Hato-chan!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:43.130
So while I'm introducing myself, why don't 
I hand out some of my favorite BL doujinshi?

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:44.770
Do you carry those everywhere?

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:48.570
I just happened to have some today. I hope 
you don't mind which character's on top.

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.200
If we do, are you going to quit?

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:53.470
Don't worry, I'm okay 
with almost any pairing.

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.080
I do not object to their marriage.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.240
Seriously? Personally, I like it when one 
swears an oath of fealty to the other.

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.660
This is...

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:05.040
No! At this rate we won't even be an otaku
 circle, we'll end up as a rotten girl circle!

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:07.040
I'm sorry, Sasahara-san.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:11.100
Maybe I did something wrong... Or maybe it was
 going to end up this way no matter what!

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.830
Can I see them too?

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:14.380
Here you go.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:24.340
Is that a wig?

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.550
Um, I...

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.820
No, I mean I...

00:08:28.850 --> 00:08:31.500
A guy? Dressed as a girl?

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:47.490
I see! That dedication to shaving!

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:51.110
The loose-fitting clothes that hide 
the figure! That natural makeup!

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:54.770
And voice training to sound like a girl!

00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.580
My extensive training 
means I can tell for sure!

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:01.760
She did everything she could 
do before she came here today!

00:09:01.760 --> 00:09:04.330
So she could talk with us!

00:09:04.770 --> 00:09:06.890
Welcome to Genshiken, Hato-kun!

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.710
Can you tell us your full name?

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.140
Hato Kenjiro!

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:17.860
I've got the perfect cosplay for you.

00:09:17.860 --> 00:09:20.590
Um, I don't really do that.

00:09:20.590 --> 00:09:24.490
No, now's not the time for that.

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:25.590
This is gonna be fun!

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:26.760
If she loves these things...

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:28.310
I must summon Tanaka-san!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:33.090
Why is Kuchiki-sempai smiling harder 
than I've ever seen him smile this year?

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:37.780
I knew it. This is a circle of weirdos.

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:42.850
Ogiue hates otaku!

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:46.140
She especially hates otaku women!

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:49.460
This circle's a little 
crazier than I anticipated.

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:51.690
I guess university circles are like that.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:54.690
How did you know?

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.720
"Rararame-san."

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.010
Um, well...

00:10:02.010 --> 00:10:04.650
Should I play along?

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:10.340
"Don't say my name like you're 
singing in a musical." Was that it?

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.850
"I'm sorry, I bit my tongue."

00:10:11.850 --> 00:10:13.280
"No. That was deliberate."

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.360
"I blit my twongue!"

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.090
So we're doing the whole thing then.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.270
Bye.

00:10:17.270 --> 00:10:19.320
Did you come here just to do that?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:28.400
What? This is from Ogiue-san!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:30.770
You want me to answer it?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.590
Hello?

00:10:32.960 --> 00:10:34.730
Yes, this is Madarame.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:37.380
Madarame-sempai?

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:39.590
Sue told me to pick up.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:41.790
No, no permanent damage.

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:45.670
"Your house is haunted!"

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.130
A welcome party?

00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.770
Okay, you're out of time!

00:10:52.770 --> 00:10:54.830
You think too much, Madarame-san.

00:10:54.830 --> 00:10:58.730
But I can't tell! Is one 
of them really a guy?

00:10:58.730 --> 00:10:59.640
Yup.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:04.280
I'll ask again at the end of the 
party, so pay close attention!

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:09.400
Give me a break. I'm 
terrible at these things.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.690
I really can't tell.

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.600
I kind of like him.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.690
He'd totally be the bottom.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:20.350
Nobody from Sasahara's year came, so why us?

00:11:20.350 --> 00:11:22.250
Kugayama had work.

00:11:22.250 --> 00:11:25.650
I'm sorry. I thought it would 
be better to have guys here.

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:28.200
I had no luck with 
Sasahara-san or the others.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.090
I see.

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.870
Okay, off we go to President Ogiue's house!

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:34.330
We'll drink at her house!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:37.260
What are you talking about? We were 
going to go to a bar somewhere!

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:40.610
It'll be more fun this way, 
and it's really close!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:43.560
But Madarame-sempai's house 
is five minutes on foot!

00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:44.240
My house?

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:46.160
No, we should go to the 
current president's house!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.980
You should have at least warned me!

00:11:47.980 --> 00:11:50.710
Hello there. I'm Sasahara.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.100
I got these at a convienence store.

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.220
There's the editor!

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:56.170
So can you tell, Sasahara?

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:59.490
Well, it's not that hard.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.610
Seriously?

00:12:00.610 --> 00:12:02.720
You're out of time.

00:12:04.830 --> 00:12:06.560
I don't know.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:08.780
He's totally going to say it's me.

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.650
I like what I'm seeing!

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:11.440
Hello there.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:14.280
What? Is it all otaku women this year?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:18.850
Welcome, you two! Sorry for dragging you here.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:21.280
Otaku women and rotten girls are different!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.320
I'm sorry. I don't understand at all.

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.130
Hey, you're dressed like a girl.

00:12:26.130 --> 00:12:27.100
Only one glance...

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.400
Way to go, Saki-san!

00:12:28.400 --> 00:12:29.230
What are you talking about?

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:33.520
We were just having a quiz about that! 
Madarame-san couldn't tell at all!

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:38.610
You haven't changed a bit.
 You watch too much anime.

00:12:40.370 --> 00:12:42.410
I can't really disagree.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.670
Hey the--

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:55.690
Is this like a game where 
I'm supposed to ignore her?

00:12:55.690 --> 00:12:58.320
You may not know it, but you guessed right!

00:12:58.320 --> 00:13:01.330
Jeez. Recruitment time is over.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.590
Don't make her cosplay all the time.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:06.570
No, we still don't know for sure.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:09.860
There have been people in the 
past who've joined and then quit.

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:14.500
And some people like you have 
come from other circles.

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:26.360
So as president, we need you to do all
 you can to make the three of them stay.

00:13:26.360 --> 00:13:29.440
Hato-kun especially! Don't let her get away!

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:32.630
You just want to make her 
cosplay, Ohno-sempai!

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.220
What's wrong, Sue?

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.290
My butt's cold.

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:42.440
I let you wear panties and 
stockings, unlike the anime,

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.850
so it should be a little easier.

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:46.050
I'm not saying a word.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.080
Then why not sit in a chair?

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.950
As president, she says...

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:53.520
But I'm not good with that stuff.

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:58.430
I knew that, and that's why I drew 
a picture for our recruitment.

00:13:58.430 --> 00:13:59.240
Yo.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:00.160
Hey.

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:04.610
Hato-kun probably changes somewhere 
before she comes to the circle.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.200
I would imagine so.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.880
I've never seen Hato-chan around campus.

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:11.750
And I only saw her wig off 
for a second, and only once.

00:14:11.750 --> 00:14:14.770
If she was dressed like a guy, 
I'd never recognize her.

00:14:14.770 --> 00:14:17.160
Well you can't go around dressed 
like a girl at school all the time.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:18.100
Yeah.

00:14:18.100 --> 00:14:19.800
That's true.

00:14:19.800 --> 00:14:22.630
What did you say?

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.800
I feel kind of betrayed. I was 
looking for her every day.

00:14:26.800 --> 00:14:31.520
But when I think that she might be changing 
somewhere on campus even as we speak...

00:14:33.640 --> 00:14:35.570
I'm going to go on a search,

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:39.040
and when I find what I'm looking for I 
might attack it, but that's just who I am!

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.720
Wait!

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:43.130
He's horrible.

00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:45.720
You don't think Hato-kun changes at home?

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:50.850
I think so too, but if she changes at 
school there'll be big, big trouble.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:54.710
Kuchiki-kun might actually do it! 
Contact Hato-kun now! Right now!

00:14:55.320 --> 00:14:56.740
He might actually do what?

00:14:56.740 --> 00:14:58.070
You know her number, right?

00:14:58.070 --> 00:14:59.510
I do, yes.

00:14:59.510 --> 00:15:00.830
Is that what he's like?

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:04.060
It's your job as president to 
protect Hato-kun's chastity.

00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:07.360
What the heck?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.380
Hello?

00:15:13.380 --> 00:15:17.740
Is this Hato-kun? I'm sorry to bother 
you. This is Ogiue from Genshiken.

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:18.480
Yes.

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.240
Do you have a minute?

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:23.590
Yes, I do.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.200
Are you changing right now?

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:28.050
Yes, I am actually.

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:29.190
I'm sorry.

00:15:29.190 --> 00:15:30.150
It's okay.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.690
Um, by the way, are you at home right now?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:37.910
Yes.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:40.730
I see. I'm glad.

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:42.660
No, um...

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:47.360
Kuchiki-kun is wandering 
the school looking for you.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.930
It's kind of a shame.

00:15:48.930 --> 00:15:50.970
Kuchiki-kun wouldn't work.

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.130
You heard her.

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:58.160
I'm glad, President. One of the members 
of Genshiken was about to go to jail.

00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:01.180
That was kind of thrilling! 
That's our president for you!

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:03.150
What's our president? I'm not really sure.

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:06.210
But we didn't stop Kuchiki-sempai himself.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:10.980
Isn't there still a chance he might 
commit a crime as he searches for Hato?

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.990
I can't stop him.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:17.030
Let's forget about it.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:21.950
Anyway, didn't you guys get used to 
Hato's cross-dressing awfully fast?

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.460
Did we?

00:16:23.640 --> 00:16:28.300
To be honest, I'm still a little... 
I mean a lot... bothered by it.

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:35.650
It's probably 'cause we saw Kousaka-san.

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.880
That guy we met? He crossdresses?

00:16:37.880 --> 00:16:38.970
Yeah.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:44.010
He did once, and unlike Hato-kun he didn't 
put any effort into it but he was perfect!

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.520
It's not fair.

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.150
I'd love to see that!

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:50.990
And Saki-san cosplays too.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.610
She does?

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:55.080
Of course, so does Ogiue-san!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:55.630
What?

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.570
Don't say that!

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:02.390
Tanaka-san and Madarame-san and 
Kugayama-san were all big otaku too.

00:17:02.390 --> 00:17:06.630
Kuchiki-kun and Ogiue-san were 
dropouts from other circles too.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.810
There's lots of weirdos in Genshiken.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:12.210
So a Hato-kun or two isn't that bad.

00:17:12.620 --> 00:17:13.640
I see.

00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:16.800
If you say that, it might scare 
off the new circle members!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.570
I'm sorry.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.220
What is it, Sue?

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:22.770
It's time for the 500th...

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:26.210
"Does Hato-kun have a dong 
in his heart?" meeting!

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.050
His heart?

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.950
Like, does he really <i>believe</i> in his dong?

00:17:28.220 --> 00:17:30.380
Sue's just as bad.

00:17:29.610 --> 00:17:30.820
Ignore her.

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:35.700
Then let's talk about which Warring 
States general was the most attractive!

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:36.330
I'm going to the bathroom.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:44.330
I think everybody's starting to settle in, 
but I guess we've got a long way to go.

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.730
Yoshitake-san is always so hyper.

00:17:46.730 --> 00:17:50.250
Unlike Kuchiki-sempai, she 
has some sense though.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.580
Yajima-san's a little hard-headed.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:56.130
But she also seems a lot calmer than I am.

00:17:56.290 --> 00:17:59.090
Ignoring Sue, the exchange student...

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:03.510
And I guess that leaves Hato-kun? 
There's a lot I don't know about her.

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.770
Hello, Hato-kun.

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:10.230
Hello there...

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:14.710
You just said you were changing at home.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.730
Hato-kun, you're not...

00:18:26.540 --> 00:18:28.550
No, wait! Hato-kun!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.520
She's fast!

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:35.750
If I lose her here she may stop cross-dressing, 
and never come back to Genshiken!

00:18:38.630 --> 00:18:40.760
Stop her, Kuchiki-sempai!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:59.850
I'm sorry, Kuchiki-sempai! I did judo until 
middle school, so it was just instinct!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.420
I'm sorry!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.390
She can protect her own chastity.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:11.870
So it's time for the first, 
"Hato-chan that's a crime," meeting!

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:14.050
It really is, Hato-kun.

00:19:14.050 --> 00:19:14.890
I know.

00:19:14.890 --> 00:19:18.570
A cosplayer should never 
change in the toilet anyway.

00:19:18.570 --> 00:19:19.730
Is that the issue?

00:19:19.730 --> 00:19:23.080
And if you do it in the girls' bathroom, 
the police would have to get involved!

00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:24.190
I know.

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:29.000
I figured if I was careful when I went in 
the girl's bathroom, that would be better.

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:32.100
When you leave the boys' bathroom you 
don't know what it'll be like outside.

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:36.500
That's not the issue. 
Can't you change at home?

00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:41.520
I did at first, but it's thirty minutes 
away, so it'd be an hour-long trip.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:44.620
And if you add in the time it takes 
to put on makeup and get dressed,

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:48.080
I'd be really late to the circle sometimes.

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:53.040
You could just change here. We can 
wait outside a little, right?

00:19:53.040 --> 00:19:56.740
Of course we could. Sue 
does her cosplay here.

00:19:56.740 --> 00:20:02.060
I don't want you guys 
to think of me as a man.

00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.050
I think we're past that point.

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:10.920
Why don't you just come dressed as a guy?

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:13.640
This is only a problem 'cause 
you're dressing like a girl.

00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:17.110
I don't know if I'm quite sure 
about a rotten guy, but...

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:22.620
Wouldn't it be easier for both of 
us to get used to things that way?

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:28.330
You don't understand anything.

00:20:28.710 --> 00:20:30.410
Kuchiki-sempai?

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:34.010
You cannot accept the miracle 
you see before your very eyes.

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:36.540
I shall tell you then, fool.

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:39.030
Listen.

00:20:39.510 --> 00:20:41.000
"Someone this cute..."

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.720
Don't say "couldn't possibly 
be a girl," please.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:51.080
If I could've said those words, 
I could've gone on to heaven.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:53.270
Go to the afterlife right now, please.

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:54.580
It doesn't end, does it?

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.450
I don't mind it though.

00:20:56.450 --> 00:21:00.880
What should we do, Ogiue-san? We may 
just have to have her change at home.

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:04.900
There's a place she can change.

00:21:08.170 --> 00:21:09.870
Let's go, Hato.

00:21:10.460 --> 00:21:11.910
Yeah!

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:17.610
Wha--

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.120
Huh?

00:21:20.120 --> 00:21:21.930
Thank you!

00:21:21.930 --> 00:21:22.620
It's fine...

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:25.720
Way to go, Hato-chan! You got a spare key!

00:21:25.720 --> 00:21:29.370
Is this circle really gonna be okay?

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:13.240
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:13.240
It feels like every anime 
lately is a second season.

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:16.950
Well, our title is "Second Generation", 
but this is actually season three!

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:18.910
We're back for more!

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:21.290
Are we allowed to talk about that on the air?

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.800
We can if it's the preview, usually.

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.510
There were OVAs too, so you could 
technically call it season four!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:30.380
I'll talk to the manga author later.

00:23:30.560 --> 00:23:33.790
I can see him smirking outside the studio.

00:23:33.790 --> 00:23:36.100
We'll wipe that smirk off his face!

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:39.930
Next time on <i>Genshiken Second 
Generation</i>: "Cross Over My Legs".
